Z||000000||KnightRyder31||06-09-2000||10:09 PM||||I was at a light this morning...in the turn lane, and some hot shot in a newer grand am gt started to rev his engine at me. I looked at him funny and smiled, but in my head I thought I was going to be burned. Light turns green...we both floor it. We were side by side, when I was about to shift outta 1st gear(I have an auto, I was power shifting) my lane was about to come to a end! I shifted into 2nd and for some odd reason I totaly blew right by him. And man he was pissed off! I couldnt believe I beat him...by the way, I only have a 84 Coupe, with a L4. I dont see how I one...or even kept up with this guy. Oh I raced the same guy again on the way home from work...this time, while we were going 50MPH. I still beat him! I dont get it, this was no youngster, he was at least 25yrs old.<BR>Oh well, I'm happy.||||reg||1
Z||000001||My7Fieros||06-09-2000||10:19 PM||||No youngster..25? Man Im 28 and you're making me feel like grandpa! (Wheezing)..you little whipper snapper! In my day we didnt have all these fancy shmancy auto-mobiles! I had to walk to school uphill both ways in ten feet of snow!<BR>Seriously, beet a GA in a 4banger huh...pretty cool..Id be happy too! Sometimes you just never know what these things can do! Gotta love em.||||reg||1
Z||000002||KnightRyder31||06-10-2000||10:10 AM||||Hey, hey, hey. I'm no oldie, I'm only 18. I was just saying that he wasnt some young kid racing anything that moved. Oh yeah, where do you live??? I'd like to see 7 fieros in one persons yard...that would be cool. You may thing I', the youngster hotshot, maybe I am...I never lost a road race before. And I know your a cop, and thats cool. I know some pretty cool cops around here.||||reg||1
