Z||000006||My7Fieros||06-10-2000||02:50 PM||||Awww, easy folks, lets just be proud Fieros are kickin A**, regardless if they're 4 or 6 bangers. Listen, Ive driven a 93 Mercury Tracer, (NOT mine!)which is the equivalent of an escort...it had a 1.8 or some rediculas tiny motor like that in it, and let me tell you, that thing would SCOOT off the line! I was judging my own sanity! So you never know just what a 4 banger will do!<BR>And KnightRyder, as far as 7 Fieros in the yard, I live in an apartment....PLENTY of parking spaces! ;-) The management here is really cool..always laughing and saying "are you gonna open a Fiero dealership here or what!"...I'll have to park them all side by side and take a panaramic pic! lol...once I figure out how to post a pic on this forum.||||reg||14
