Z||000018||Formula||06-11-2000||02:15 AM||||I find it weird sometimes too.....<P>I lost to a 94ish Grand am GT (long straight away with no traffic) but I creamed a newish maybe even a 99 Grand am in a close race to about 30.  There is a stop light in town that has extreme bumps and the passing lane is smoother and you can watch the other light switch.  But I only beat 4 bangers most of the time at other stop lights. oh well........dont really race anymore anyways.||||reg||1
